{"unit_id":"YuanyuanMa03__dsh-funnel#card-zh","repo":"YuanyuanMa03/dsh-funnel","commit":"596361966226a89c2361ac0250b41f6541ce9ea5","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-funnel 是一个适用于 DSH 各类客户端的工具输出整理插件。它挂接工具执行流程，在成功结果进入模型上下文前递归筛选其中过长的文本，保留开头、结尾以及包含错误或警告关键词的行，并用省略标记说明删去的行数。用户可以调整字符阈值、保留行数、关键词、单行上限和逐工具策略；默认把完整文本写入工作目录下的 .dsh-funnel 并在整理结果中提供路径，也可关闭暂存。适合经常处理冗长命令日志、网页或文件内容的 DSH 用户。需要 Node.js 20 或更高版本，不需要 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:31-63","lib/transform.mjs:45-87"]}
{"unit_id":"YuanyuanMa03__dsh-funnel#card-en","repo":"YuanyuanMa03/dsh-funnel","commit":"596361966226a89c2361ac0250b41f6541ce9ea5","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-funnel curates long strings in successful DSH tool results before they reach the model. It keeps head, tail, and matching error or warning lines, marks omissions, and can save full text locally with a pointer. Users can tune thresholds and per-tool rules. Requires Node.js 20+; no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:31-63","lib/transform.mjs:45-87"]}
